  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 3.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "So, hi, sit anywhere you like."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.32,
      "end_seconds": 6.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.3,
      "end_seconds": 10.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.98,
      "end_seconds": 24.97,
      "duration_seconds": 12.99,
      "text": "doctor, it's a dry cough in the evenings it's getting on my nerves now my sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.19,
      "end_seconds": 28.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.28,
      "end_seconds": 30.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "nothing regular, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.05,
      "end_seconds": 34.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.54,
      "end_seconds": 46.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "probably about two weeks yeah i just want to get back to normal, really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.4,
      "end_seconds": 57.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.66,
      "text": "okay, can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.79,
      "end_seconds": 69.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.48,
      "text": "Honestly, all the time. I'd give it a a eight, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.82,
      "end_seconds": 74.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.37,
      "text": "Sneezing fits goes along with it, most of the time. The Sneezing fits? That's been for one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.6,
      "end_seconds": 104.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Right, and what about wheeze, fever or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.61,
      "end_seconds": 110.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "no, you know, nothing to report there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.18,
      "end_seconds": 114.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.56,
      "end_seconds": 116.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.42,
      "end_seconds": 122.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.54,
      "end_seconds": 133.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "I had a reaction to diclofenac when I was younger, swelling of my lips, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.87,
      "end_seconds": 138.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.88,
      "end_seconds": 141.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "not really, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.92,
      "end_seconds": 144.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "What do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.59,
      "end_seconds": 148.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.76,
      "end_seconds": 152.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.79,
      "end_seconds": 157.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.82,
      "end_seconds": 173.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.28,
      "end_seconds": 182.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "No, you know, I've never been operated on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.99,
      "end_seconds": 186.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll do your observations first"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.35,
      "end_seconds": 194.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.64,
      "end_seconds": 214.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "okay: saturation 97 percent, temperature is 36.6 degrees, pulse 82, respiratory rate 18, BP is 126 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.1,
      "end_seconds": 216.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.41,
      "end_seconds": 221.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.45,
      "end_seconds": 227.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.51,
      "end_seconds": 243.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "fine by me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.56,
      "end_seconds": 247.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.84,
      "end_seconds": 268.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.23,
      "end_seconds": 271.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.02,
      "end_seconds": 285.12,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "You can relax now. Putting it all together, it it points towards seasonal hay fever causing the cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.79,
      "end_seconds": 319.42,
      "duration_seconds": 21.63,
      "text": "For this, fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. That should help with hay fever. Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. If you start wheezing, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.76,
      "end_seconds": 322.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "alright, I follow"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.41,
      "end_seconds": 331.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "I'd like to to see you again in a month. Okay, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.32,
      "end_seconds": 335.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.27,
      "end_seconds": 338.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "all the best"
    }
  ]
